{
  "_name_comment": "THE NAME THE RELEASE ALREADY PUBLISHES UNDER. This said `@anthropic-ai/folio-assistant` until 2026-09-20 while `release-folio-assistant.yml` carried `sed -i 's/@anthropic-ai/@litlfred/' package.json` immediately before `npm publish`, alongside an `.npmrc` writing `@litlfred:registry=...`. So the published identity was `@litlfred/folio-assistant` and the DECLARED one was not \u2014 two answers to one question, with the declaration losing at build time. Bean `frq2`. The sed is gone: an identity is declared, never patched on the way out.",
